823	     * Validates an optional owner postcode. A postcode is optional, so a {@code null} value is
824	     * accepted and left unchanged. When present it must be exactly 4 digits, and when the owner's
825	     * city has a known region (see {@link Owner#regionForCity(String)}) the postcode must fall
826	     * within that region's inclusive range ({@code NSW 2000-2099}, {@code VIC 3000-3099},
827	     * {@code QLD 4000-4099}, see {@link Owner#postcodeRangeForRegion(String)}). A city with no known
